title: A file an assistant makes or changes does not take the canvas there while nobody follows it; once it is followed, its changes do
folders: rust-small
limit: 45
expect-log: an assistant \(Claude Code\) is on the canvas
expect-log: src/made\.rs changed where an assistant that is not followed works: the canvas stays where it is
forbid-log: src/util\.rs changed where an assistant that is not followed works
forbid-log: script: agent needs

wait 3000
fit
wait 1000
agent {"source":"claude","hook":{"session_id":"s1","hook_event_name":"PreToolUse","cwd":"{WORK}/fix/rust-small","tool_name":"Write","tool_input":{"file_path":"{WORK}/fix/rust-small/src/made.rs","content":"fn made() {}"}}}
wait 800
touch src/made.rs fn made() {}
wait 3000
mark the-whole-folder-still
wait 500
agent Claude Code
wait 2500
touch src/util.rs // written while it is followed
wait 3000
mark at-the-change-of-util
wait 500
quit
